window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Theo barely survived the deadly poison that nearly claimed his life, but survival is only the beginning of his journey. As he recovers, a new fire ignites within him, pushing him to leave Ashenvale village and forge a new path.<br> <br> His vision? East Wind, an enterprise that quickly spreads its influence across the empire and beyond, offering enchanted crops from his demonic farm. <br> <br> But peace is short-lived. A mysterious disease begins to sweep the continent, tearing families apart and plunging society into chaos. With lives hanging in the balance, Theo finds himself at the heart of the storm, caught between the looming threat of the pandemic and the shadow of an old enemy, Cedric, who has unfinished business with him. <br> <br> As Theo's business empire grows, so do the stakes. Secrets from the past resurface, and the battle for survival takes on a whole new meaning. With his demonic farm as both a weapon and a lifeline, Theo must navigate treacherous waters. <br> <br> <b>Will Theo's strength and cunning be enough to save his world, or will the forces against him bring him to his knees?</b> <br> <br> The fight is far from over. Dive into the next chapter, where power, strategy, and destiny collide in a race against time.</p>"; 
